    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A boy, a bear, and the long way home through memory.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Beyond the Hundred Acre</i> is a minimalist puzzle-adventure where you guide a young boy and his loyal bear through a fading dream of childhood. With no combat or dialogue, the story unfolds through silent cooperation, environmental puzzles, and the quiet atmosphere of a forgotten forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748320/extras/912b92cfb730a34a4f3b51c954a37dce.avif?t=1752932159\" data-has-big width=800 height=336 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Characters, One Bond</strong><br> between a boy and a slow-moving bear. Use teamwork to climb ledges, move platforms, trigger switches, and solve environmental puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thoughtful Puzzle Design</strong><br>Each puzzle is handcrafted and integrated into the environment\u2014requiring intuition, timing, and cooperation instead of tutorials or UI hints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Story Told Without Words</strong><br>There\u2019s no dialogue, cutscenes, or HUD. The emotional arc unfolds through movement, animation and lighting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Short, Complete Experience</strong><br>Designed to be finished in a single sitting: roughly <strong>1 to 2 hours</strong>. Ideal for players seeking an emotional and compact narrative adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for Immersion</strong><br>Full controller support, minimal UI</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quick Facts</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre</strong>: Puzzle-Adventure, Atmospheric</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime</strong>: 60\u201390 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single Player</strong>: Yes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong>: None</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engine</strong>: Unreal Engine 5</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Languages</strong>: English (more TBA)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A boy, a bear, and the long way home through memory.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Beyond the Hundred Acre</i> is a minimalist puzzle-adventure where you guide a young boy and his loyal bear through a fading dream of childhood. With no combat or dialogue, the story unfolds through silent cooperation, environmental puzzles, and the quiet atmosphere of a forgotten forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748320/extras/912b92cfb730a34a4f3b51c954a37dce.avif?t=1752932159\" data-has-big width=800 height=336 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Characters, One Bond</strong><br> between a boy and a slow-moving bear. Use teamwork to climb ledges, move platforms, trigger switches, and solve environmental puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thoughtful Puzzle Design</strong><br>Each puzzle is handcrafted and integrated into the environment\u2014requiring intuition, timing, and cooperation instead of tutorials or UI hints.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Story Told Without Words</strong><br>There\u2019s no dialogue, cutscenes, or HUD. The emotional arc unfolds through movement, animation and lighting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Short, Complete Experience</strong><br>Designed to be finished in a single sitting: roughly <strong>1 to 2 hours</strong>. Ideal for players seeking an emotional and compact narrative adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for Immersion</strong><br>Full controller support, minimal UI</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quick Facts</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre</strong>: Puzzle-Adventure, Atmospheric</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime</strong>: 60\u201390 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single Player</strong>: Yes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong>: None</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engine</strong>: Unreal Engine 5</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Languages</strong>: English (more TBA)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
